{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "e4eff6e933cd3473c209690c75dfe98206ff3192317642602e90376f9f24aec2", "ja": "ねえねえ兄ちゃーん。そろそろ真美のこと、\nレンアイタイショーになった？　よっ、タイショー！", "zh": "欸欸大哥哥～差不多该把真美视为恋爱对象了吧？\n嘿，对象～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ad33808eb36e673a0a6d87ea451eb2461a812e57d65f9c5adc56aa1fa5d9e8bb", "ja": "な、なんだ、いきなり。恋愛対象？\nそろそろも何も、考えたこともない……かな？", "zh": "怎、怎么啦，突然说这个？恋爱对象？\n别说差不多了，我根本想都没想过……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "f91f1597b91a3cbf7bb73a8c08a2bb3f13094a8d662500bf79b0834f135a3faa", "ja": "え～？　でもりおっちが、ハダカのツキアイをしたら、\nタイショーになれるって言ってたよ？", "zh": "咦～？可是莉绪绪说只要裸身交流，\n就可以成为对象啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1003_p", "source_sha256": "20dbfd35a1c2b1aa6a91ee6f36107e009ea76e1ceccb4b3d4e9e5560eed1a01a", "ja": "犯人は莉緒か……。で、裸の付き合いってのは、\nこないだ真美がバスタオルでうろついてた時の？", "zh": "犯人是莉绪吗……等等，你说裸身交流，\n是指之前真美包着浴巾四处晃的时候吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "c14e22433c7faca58ed03ed2ec5c48e1f39baeae8d7ce1db4f1d3b1bb41d42a1", "ja": "そそ！　麦茶がメッチャおいしかった時！\n真美のアレレ？な姿、兄ちゃんも超見たっしょ？", "zh": "对对！麦茶超好喝那次！\n真美「不得了」的模样，大哥哥也看到超多的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b7107be28ffe36043a485c23b9988ca408adbf96b73740f88bbdab6d6ded5e1f", "ja": "あられもない姿なら、確かに見せられたけど……\nでも間違ってるぞ、真美。", "zh": "如果是说「不得体」的模样，你确实有让我看到……\n不过你错了，真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "45065de54c9f2efab9770f0358e7935a3434d4f83d8311f09eff2b549acc8dc4", "ja": "えっ、なになに？　どゆこと？", "zh": "咦，什么什么？哪里错了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1007_p", "source_sha256": "57f9aecb6f7e3d83c015851b2afa9f379ef6feb26e5ede512b6f97c0f17642f2", "ja": "裸の付き合いっていうのは、お互いに裸ってことだ。\nだけど、あの時……俺は脱いでなかった！", "zh": "所谓的裸身交流，要双方都是赤裸的。\n但那时候……我并没有脱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "296e836aa8c64600f079802000ae6fca1a2df556dbb937cd3fedfbdb80baa80d", "ja": "ああっ！　そっかー！\n目からスノコだよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "啊！是这样啊～！\n我「恍然起雾」了，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1009_p", "source_sha256": "03dacbb9e1a66cc411a0dc04b888698cd8eb7968c41829b8527015f6b2ee1a06", "ja": "それはよかった……ウロコだけどな。", "zh": "那真是太好了……不过是「恍然大悟」喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "401b3b7af826f988a8e8cf2fa1e7612dfc642204adec7f52f349389c4e3e2c66", "ja": "じゃあじゃあー、次こそスポンと脱いで、\n真美とハダカのツキアイしよーね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "那那～下次就把长裤脱了，\n和真美做裸身交流吧～大哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0062_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "3493316b6c2612f1770713d7731141fc68fb2c7d423052f2b23a64ac75209175", "ja": "あ、パンツまでは脱がなくていいから安心して？\n真美もオニじゃないし～。んっふっふ～♪", "zh": "啊，不用连内裤都脱掉，你可以放心喔！\n毕竟真美也没那么狠～嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
